<h3 class="bde-heading-104-394 bde-heading">
Ms Alisha - From India
</h3><div class="bde-fancy-divider-104-395 bde-fancy-divider">


<div class="bde-fancy-divider__wrapper">
  <div class="bde-fancy-divider__separator   ">
  	  </div>
</div>

</div><div class="bde-text-104-396 bde-text">
I had the privilege of witnessing the entire production process — from mulberry cultivation and silkworm breeding to the final handcrafted products showcased in the showroom. Hanhsilk's silk fabric is completely natural and meticulously handmade by artisans from the Nam Cao Tussah silk village. It was truly an amazing experience!
</div>
</div></div>
</div>
</div><div class="bde-advancedslide-104-397 bde-advancedslide swiper-slide">
<div class="advanced-slider__slide">
  <div class="bde-columns-104-398 bde-columns"><div class="bde-column-104-399 bde-column">
  
  
	



