<h3 class="bde-heading-104-410 bde-heading">
Mr. David - From the UK
</h3><div class="bde-fancy-divider-104-411 bde-fancy-divider">


<div class="bde-fancy-divider__wrapper">
  <div class="bde-fancy-divider__separator   ">
  	  </div>
</div>

</div><div class="bde-text-104-412 bde-text">
"I am a silk merchant and a silk culture scholar. I have also traveled to many countries to study the history, process, and materials of silk. For me, Hạnh Silk's silk is very high quality, laborious, and most importantly, the people of Hạnh Silk are all passionate, loving, rustic, and simple. Therefore, Hạnh Silk is always my first choice when looking for silk."
</div>
